menu "LBR dashboard (cockpit display)"

    config LBR_IO_BATTERY
        string "Slot 'battery' input spec"
        default ""
        help
            Channels, in order: DASH_BATTERY (percent). Typically an
            'adc ...' entry on an ADC1 pin of the ESP32-C5 (GPIO 1..6) behind
            a divider. Empty = not fitted (or simulated with LBR_SENSOR_SIM).
            Syntax: car/components/sensors/include/lbr/sensor_io.h and
            docs/sensors.md. Battery capacity and charging are TBD. The
            dashboard joins the Central's access point
            (CONFIG_LBR_WIFI_SSID / CONFIG_LBR_WIFI_PASSWORD).

endmenu
